Description: minimal Terminal UI for Excel files
 xltui is a minimal terminal UI for Excel (.xlsx) files written in .NET.
 It renders a sheet as a table or a tree, can filter columns and group
 rows, and can emit a sheet as JSON.
 .
 This package ships upstream's prebuilt self-contained binary, which loads
 whichever ICU library (libicu70 to libicu78) the system provides.
